<title>USA: Cash Can Names Bolles CFO.</title>
<headline>Cash Can Names Bolles CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cash Can Inc Thursday named Peter Bolles to the post of chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Bolles was previously head of a San Francisco-based diversified architectural, planning design and urban development company.</p>
<p>A representative of the company was not immediately availble to comment on whether the position is new or if Bolles is replacing another executive.</p>
